## On the Road

<match on="run.leg">
  <when is="..1">
    @narrator: Ostwick's walls drop behind the hills. The road is good here. The Company built it well.
  </when>
  <when is="2">
    @narrator: The river runs beside the road, brown and fast, and the milestones start to carry the black sun.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @narrator: The Tollbridge chain is visible from every rise now, a black line across the morning.
  </otherwise>
</match>
